WEBVTT

00:01.600 --> 00:06.930
Up until now, I've only thought
about becoming stronger.

00:07.300 --> 00:11.770
I wanted Master Zico and everyone else
to acknowledge me.

00:11.770 --> 00:14.210
And I wanted to catch up to you, Zed.

00:14.210 --> 00:16.770
I was only thinking of myself.

00:17.650 --> 00:24.090
But see, in my dream, when Mother held
me in her arms, I realized...

00:24.090 --> 00:28.090
I want to help people too.

00:28.090 --> 00:32.250
I want to use my abilities to
save people who are hurt.

00:33.190 --> 00:35.360
What the hell is this about?!

00:35.360 --> 00:37.770
What's Roya done wrong?!

00:37.770 --> 00:39.100
Well?!

00:39.100 --> 00:42.870
If you take this any further,

00:42.870 --> 00:47.640
I'll have to arrest you for interfering
with official duties.

00:48.310 --> 00:51.780
Like hell I can follow your Absolute Law!

00:51.780 --> 00:53.010
Get out of my way.

00:53.010 --> 00:54.810
Give Roya back!

00:56.250 --> 01:01.520
You're just the same as you were back in Calm.

01:14.600 --> 01:22.210
Far away from the town where I was born

01:22.210 --> 01:25.380
I am singing

01:25.380 --> 01:33.020
Tucking my weak heart and my wavering feelings

01:33.020 --> 01:36.290
Away in my pocket

01:36.290 --> 01:41.830
Toward where I hear someone calling me

01:41.830 --> 01:46.870
Toward the unknown road

01:46.870 --> 01:52.310
I'll walk

01:52.310 --> 01:57.710
I'll move forward

01:57.710 --> 02:02.550
Not for someone else's sake

02:02.550 --> 02:08.020
But just as I am, so that I can take pride

02:08.020 --> 02:13.500
Just as the sun rises at dawn

02:13.500 --> 02:18.730
I pick out a melody with my voice

02:18.730 --> 02:22.760
Ephemerally yet strongly

02:24.410 --> 02:27.930
I live

02:34.450 --> 02:38.750
Episode 29
Friendship at Cross-Purposes

02:34.950 --> 02:38.750


That's right, I've been wishing for this moment.

02:39.690 --> 02:41.950
I've always wanted to fight you.

02:43.090 --> 02:47.590
I want to test myself and find out
whether I've caught up to you.

02:48.530 --> 02:52.400
Noah, what are you talking about?

02:52.400 --> 02:55.200
Here I come, Zed!

03:14.760 --> 03:17.780
I don't have time to fight you right now!

03:19.790 --> 03:22.660
You haven't changed, Zed.

03:22.660 --> 03:26.130
But under Neotopia's Absolute Law,

03:26.130 --> 03:29.000
no matter how much fuss you kick up,
it will get you nowhere.

03:29.740 --> 03:31.900
Please, figure that out fast.

03:36.540 --> 03:38.170
Roya...

03:39.010 --> 03:40.640
Zed!

03:41.080 --> 03:42.880
Roya was...

03:42.880 --> 03:44.880
Where did they take her?!

03:47.820 --> 03:51.120
We will now begin Round One Match Six.

03:51.760 --> 03:57.250
Rahja of Tusk vs. Alec of Neotopia!

04:00.700 --> 04:02.330
Begin!

04:10.580 --> 04:11.980
Damn it...

04:11.980 --> 04:13.780
Well, then...

04:23.830 --> 04:27.100
It's just boring match after boring match!

04:27.100 --> 04:29.690
Give me my turn already.

04:31.300 --> 04:35.240
Me, the great Nudyu, and my spirit Marakia.

04:38.270 --> 04:42.440
Wow, so this is the green room for the jousters.

04:42.440 --> 04:45.250
It has such a good view of the field!

04:45.250 --> 04:49.020
I'm so tired of waiting.

04:49.020 --> 04:51.750
When is my match, again?

04:55.820 --> 04:58.330
Let's fight with spirits, then!

04:58.330 --> 04:59.950
Petelios!

05:09.940 --> 05:14.680
Petelios's scales cause temporary blindness.

05:14.680 --> 05:16.470
Here I come!

05:32.790 --> 05:34.520
Damn it!

06:00.420 --> 06:04.860
The winner: Rahja of Tusk!

06:09.960 --> 06:11.300
Don't make me repeat myself!

06:11.300 --> 06:11.370
People like you are not allowed here!

06:11.370 --> 06:12.430
Shut up!
People like you are not allowed here!

06:12.430 --> 06:13.200
Shut up!
I told you, you can't come in here!

06:13.200 --> 06:14.540
Whatever, out of my way!
I told you, you can't come in here!

06:14.540 --> 06:16.140
Nobody without authorization is allowed in here!

06:16.140 --> 06:16.400
I said no!

06:16.400 --> 06:17.440
Don't get in my way!
I said no!

06:17.440 --> 06:18.970
Roya's being held here!

06:18.970 --> 06:20.640
Knock it off! If you don't ...

06:20.640 --> 06:21.710
Move it!
Knock it off! If you don't ...

06:21.710 --> 06:23.510
Let him in.

06:27.450 --> 06:30.390
Well? Pretty nice place, isn't it?

06:30.390 --> 06:33.720
At first, I was imagining a jail cell,
so I was surprised.

06:33.720 --> 06:36.520
They haven't done anything violent either.
Don't worry.

06:36.520 --> 06:38.060
But...

06:38.060 --> 06:40.400
And after all, I'm at fault too
for breaking their law,

06:40.400 --> 06:43.800
even if I didn't know about it.

06:45.230 --> 06:48.770
Neotopia and Templar are allied nations,
you know?

06:48.770 --> 06:51.370
So, nothing too bad will happen.

06:51.370 --> 06:55.540
If we follow the proper procedures,
I'll be freed in no time.

06:55.540 --> 06:58.110
Who cares about the law?

06:58.110 --> 07:00.520
You helped people!

07:00.520 --> 07:01.880
Yeah...

07:01.880 --> 07:05.920
But I don't want to make a wrong move
and cause more trouble.

07:05.920 --> 07:07.990
If this became an international incident,

07:07.990 --> 07:10.010
that would be really bad, right?

07:11.290 --> 07:13.090
I'm telling you, don't worry.

07:13.090 --> 07:16.560
You give it your all in the Joust.

07:16.560 --> 07:19.970
It's a shame, but I'll withdraw.

07:19.970 --> 07:24.230
But you're carrying Templar on your
shoulders, so go get them!

07:25.310 --> 07:28.280
You've changed, somehow.

07:30.610 --> 07:33.610
I'm happy right now,

07:33.610 --> 07:38.650
because I've finally figured out what I should do,

07:38.650 --> 07:42.360
what I can do.

07:42.360 --> 07:45.860
Master Zico, Master Sebastian, Mickey...

07:45.860 --> 07:49.730
Everyone cares for me.

07:49.730 --> 07:52.600
Right now you're here for me.

07:54.870 --> 07:59.810
Mother was holding me in her heart all along too.

08:00.510 --> 08:05.280
But the whole time I was thinking I had nothing...

08:05.280 --> 08:08.220
not anything.

08:08.220 --> 08:11.050
Honestly, I'm an idiot.

08:15.060 --> 08:17.350
I'm all right now.

08:18.130 --> 08:20.820
I'm all right, Zed.

08:23.030 --> 08:24.660
Yeah!

08:32.910 --> 08:37.450
Zed, let us settle our fight in the Joust.

08:37.450 --> 08:41.050
Are you still going on about that?

08:41.050 --> 08:44.150
I want to put this power to the full,
unreserved test.

08:44.150 --> 08:49.020
And this strength I gained from Absolute Law...

08:49.020 --> 08:50.390
I want to test them against you.

08:50.390 --> 08:51.960
Law again, huh?

08:51.960 --> 08:53.790
What garbage.

08:55.100 --> 08:57.060
I've become strong!

08:58.930 --> 09:02.140
There's no way something like that
can make you strong.

09:02.140 --> 09:04.370
I'll teach you that.

09:11.150 --> 09:13.480
I look forward to our match.

09:23.760 --> 09:27.220
We will now begin Round One Match Seven.

09:29.060 --> 09:34.430
Helic of Ulvarx vs. Jeba of Tusk!

09:36.770 --> 09:38.400
Begin!

09:44.450 --> 09:46.240
A beastman, eh?

10:02.660 --> 10:04.630
He certainly is fast.

10:09.140 --> 10:10.910
How is Roya?

10:10.910 --> 10:13.170
She's okay for now, anyway.

10:13.170 --> 10:14.970
No need to worry.

10:16.840 --> 10:18.470
Thanks.

10:21.380 --> 10:24.250
I'm going back to the stadium.

10:24.250 --> 10:26.050
See you later.

10:37.400 --> 10:39.230
Yo!

10:39.230 --> 10:40.770
You want something?

10:40.770 --> 10:43.200
Is the cutie doing okay?

10:44.610 --> 10:46.730
Who are you?

10:47.810 --> 10:50.440
A fan of hers.

10:59.020 --> 11:01.320
Not a very sociable one, is he?

11:09.030 --> 11:11.570
He's faster than the data says!

11:11.570 --> 11:13.360
Well, then...

11:23.740 --> 11:26.880
Oh, my stomach hurts.

11:26.880 --> 11:29.370
Maybe I ate a few too many popsicles...

11:32.190 --> 11:36.320
Managing one's physical condition is
one of the duties of a shard caster.

11:39.890 --> 11:41.760
What a creep...

11:41.760 --> 11:43.730
Here it comes again?!

11:49.640 --> 11:53.270
My body won't do what I tell it to.

11:53.940 --> 11:54.940
You just watch;

11:54.940 --> 11:57.240
I'll settle this with one blow.

12:10.120 --> 12:13.530
The winner: Helic of Ulvarx!

12:19.730 --> 12:22.840
I'm told a competitor from Templar
has violated Absolute Law,

12:22.840 --> 12:25.170
and is being confined in the proper facility.

12:26.510 --> 12:28.530
What shall we do?

12:29.880 --> 12:32.850
There are no exceptions to Absolute Law.

12:39.550 --> 12:42.990
And now, we'll begin today's final match:

12:42.990 --> 12:46.430
Round One, Match Eight.

12:46.430 --> 12:51.730
Nudyu of Zymot vs. Robès of Templar!

12:53.030 --> 12:54.240
Okay...

12:54.240 --> 12:56.230
It doesn't hurt, it doesn't hurt...

12:57.270 --> 12:59.240
What a fool.

13:00.210 --> 13:03.540
Your opponent is Templar's shard champion.

13:03.540 --> 13:08.240
Let's see what you're made of, Nudyu.

13:10.320 --> 13:11.940
Begin!

13:26.930 --> 13:32.340
Hey now, you'd better not say,
"I lost because I was sick. "

13:32.340 --> 13:33.970
Marakia!

13:48.020 --> 13:49.820
I want to go to the bathroom...

13:55.700 --> 13:57.430
Belladonna!

13:57.430 --> 13:59.630
You don't have time to be watching her!

14:13.250 --> 14:14.870
Belladonna...

14:15.780 --> 14:17.410
Marakia...

14:19.150 --> 14:21.960
Their spirits' power is about equal.

14:21.960 --> 14:25.330
This ought to be a close fight, but...

14:25.330 --> 14:28.460
Is that Nudyu guy stronger after all?

14:28.460 --> 14:30.830
Who knows?

14:30.830 --> 14:34.230
Isn't the fact that reality doesn't follow the data
what makes it interesting?

14:43.580 --> 14:46.310
I just can't hit my stride...

14:46.310 --> 14:48.050
Master Robès!

14:48.050 --> 14:49.550
Get him!

14:49.550 --> 14:51.520
Don't give up hope!

14:51.520 --> 14:54.050
You have us!

14:54.050 --> 14:57.290
Hurray for Master Robès!

14:57.290 --> 15:00.660
Go, Master Robès, go!

15:02.730 --> 15:04.230
That's right...

15:04.230 --> 15:09.690
My fans, I must prove myself
worthy of your cheers!

15:11.470 --> 15:15.500
Whoa, you can get cheers like those?!

15:17.140 --> 15:19.310
I wish I had entered the competition.

15:19.610 --> 15:21.440
Go, Belladonna!

15:32.960 --> 15:34.590
Marakia!

15:47.240 --> 15:49.270
Marakia!

15:54.380 --> 15:55.850
This can't be happening...

15:55.850 --> 15:57.820
Not to my Marakia...

15:59.420 --> 16:01.910
Why, you!

16:17.040 --> 16:19.010
You really want to continue?

16:20.070 --> 16:22.540
I... I give.

16:25.280 --> 16:28.440
The winner: Robès of Templar!

16:30.480 --> 16:33.540
Master Robès, you're so dreamy!

16:33.890 --> 16:36.360
Master Robès!

16:37.690 --> 16:42.150
I... I can't believe I lost...

16:43.360 --> 16:44.830
What an idiot.

16:44.830 --> 16:47.960
So, in the end, I'm the only one still in the game?

16:54.440 --> 16:58.280
All Round One matches are now over.

16:59.380 --> 17:01.910
Round Two will take place tomorrow.

17:02.650 --> 17:12.050
The first match will be between
Noah of Neotopia and Zed of Templar.

17:14.930 --> 17:19.230
Zed, this time has come at last.

17:20.400 --> 17:22.030
Noah...

17:28.640 --> 17:32.150
All right, keep the food coming!

17:32.150 --> 17:34.850
We'll charge this all to the Templar government.

17:34.850 --> 17:36.650
Let's enjoy ourselves, ladies!

17:37.420 --> 17:39.220
You're so wonderful, Master Robès!

17:39.220 --> 17:42.590
I'm Templar's shard champion, you know.

17:42.590 --> 17:44.650
Little things like this come with the territory!

17:48.030 --> 17:51.000
Please, allow me to pay for this meal.

17:52.200 --> 17:53.370
You!

17:53.370 --> 17:55.240
Who are you, again?

17:55.240 --> 17:58.300
Isn't this the person who lost to Master Robès?

17:59.040 --> 18:01.910
Yes! What is he doing here?

18:02.610 --> 18:05.550
Listen, I hate to say this,

18:05.550 --> 18:07.580
but would you please leave?

18:07.580 --> 18:10.080
Now, don't be like that.

18:10.080 --> 18:12.750
Here, this is Neotopia-made wine.

18:12.750 --> 18:15.160
Please, try a glass, Master Robès!

18:15.160 --> 18:18.030
Oh, local wine!

18:18.030 --> 18:20.430
That does have a certain appeal.

18:23.460 --> 18:25.460
Let's see, now...

18:29.770 --> 18:31.170
How do you like it?

18:31.170 --> 18:33.640
Oh, this is great!

18:33.640 --> 18:36.040
Could I possibly have another glass?

18:49.690 --> 18:54.650
This Absolute Law thing just
doesn't sit well with me.

18:55.130 --> 18:58.230
There's no way something like that
can make you strong.

18:58.230 --> 19:00.460
I'll teach you that.

19:03.740 --> 19:08.830
Zed, I'll prove it to you by winning against you.

19:17.620 --> 19:19.850
I won't be recovering from this
illness in any event.

19:19.850 --> 19:22.020
Please let me do as I like.

19:22.020 --> 19:25.030
Rather than live a long life in a hospital bed,

19:25.030 --> 19:26.590
I'd prefer do what I please.

19:26.590 --> 19:28.750
I don't mind if my life is cut short.

19:29.900 --> 19:31.690
I want to be free.

19:32.430 --> 19:35.570
You're just the same as you were.

19:35.570 --> 19:40.940
To have true peace,
we need laws to rule the people.

19:42.740 --> 19:46.440
Noah, you're wrong.

19:54.250 --> 19:58.830
Mr. Robès, please pull yourself together.
Mr. Robès!

19:58.830 --> 20:02.420
Oh, be quiet, Jeeves.

20:04.430 --> 20:07.130
Our finances will be...

20:17.210 --> 20:20.480
That beautiful, strong spirit...

20:20.480 --> 20:22.240
Belladonna...

20:26.350 --> 20:28.650
It will be mine!

20:52.110 --> 20:54.380
Don't interfere.

20:58.150 --> 20:59.550
Today, on our second day of the Joust,

20:59.550 --> 21:01.680
we'll be holding Round Two.

21:02.490 --> 21:05.520
The competitors who have advanced
from Round One are:

21:06.460 --> 21:08.430
Robès of Templar!

21:09.330 --> 21:12.300
Zed, also of Templar!

21:13.200 --> 21:15.500
Elmeida of Zymot!

21:16.570 --> 21:20.530
Geh-Geh of Tusk, and Rahja, also of Tusk!

21:21.240 --> 21:24.370
Helic of Ulvarx.

21:24.850 --> 21:28.480
And finally, Noah of Neotopia!

21:28.480 --> 21:30.450
Those are the seven.

21:33.990 --> 21:38.550
Roya of Templar has withdrawn due to injury.

21:41.560 --> 21:44.560
I believe it was the first match, correct?

21:44.560 --> 21:46.330
Yes!

21:46.330 --> 21:50.240
A battle between two wielders of key spirits...

21:52.040 --> 21:53.870
I look forward to it.

21:54.510 --> 21:58.100
We will now begin Round Two Match One.

21:59.410 --> 22:05.370
Zed of Templar vs. Noah of Neotopia!

22:12.890 --> 22:17.350
Finally, I can fight with you and go all-out.

22:29.210 --> 22:30.840
Begin!

22:44.790 --> 22:49.560
Even if we've been far apart

22:49.560 --> 22:53.600
Our hearts are still connected

22:53.600 --> 22:57.170
And always will be, even to the end of time

22:57.170 --> 23:03.510
I want to stay shining forever and ever (stay gold)

23:03.510 --> 23:08.380
I want to stay glittering (stay gold)

23:08.380 --> 23:09.680
My old days

23:09.680 --> 23:12.050
Living it up on the weekend as always

23:12.050 --> 23:15.890
Just simply having fun, innocently

23:15.890 --> 23:19.760
Grateful days, gone in the blink of an eye

23:19.760 --> 23:22.130
Since then, we've gone our separate ways

23:22.130 --> 23:24.030
Chasing our own goals

23:24.030 --> 23:25.030
We grow up

23:25.030 --> 23:26.700
Tuck our memories in our hearts, and wave

23:26.700 --> 23:27.870
Fix our eyes on where we're going

23:27.870 --> 23:29.870
Neither of us will give up

23:29.870 --> 23:31.510
Knowing the other's fighting just as hard

23:31.510 --> 23:33.610
I don't mind if you're not near me

23:33.610 --> 23:35.580
I want to see your smile, but it's not the time

23:35.580 --> 23:36.580
The more I look back

23:36.580 --> 23:37.580
The more I tell myself I'll show this to you one day

23:37.580 --> 23:39.840
That will never change

23:40.410 --> 23:45.220
Even if we've been far apart

23:45.220 --> 23:49.290
Our hearts are still connected

23:49.290 --> 23:52.890
And always will be, even to the end of time

23:52.890 --> 23:59.230
I want to stay shining forever and ever (stay gold)

23:59.230 --> 24:04.930
I want to stay glittering (stay gold)

24:17.280 --> 24:20.940
Next Time
Showdown

24:17.920 --> 24:20.940


Next time, "Showdown"
